OL,3,GNEWSAToddler with sun allergy can play
OL,4,Ain daylight thanks to UV window film
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish toddler with a rare genetic
OL,7,Fdisorder that makes her "allergic" to
OL,8,Fthe sun can play indoors without the
OL,9,Fcurtains closed thanks to UV-resistant
OL,10,Ffilm installed on the windows.
OL,12,FTwo-year-old Mollie Murray, of
OL,13,FMontrose, is the only child in the UK
OL,14,Fknown to have her specific variant of
OL,15,Fxeroderma pigmentosum (XP), making her
OL,16,Fskin extremely sensitive to ultraviolet
OL,17,Flight.
OL,19,FThe condition, which has no cure, means
OL,20,FMollie can only safely go outside while
OL,21,Fwearing protective full-length clothing
OL,22,For after dark.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
