OL,3,GNEWSAToddler with sun allergy can play
OL,4,Ain daylight thanks to UV window film
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family was able to install the film
OL,7,Flast month with funding from a charity
OL,8,Foriginally established to support the
OL,9,Fbuild of Aberdeen's children's
OL,10,Fhospital.
